 "text": "..title\nGreenways and Open Space Commission\nElection to fill one vacancy on the Commission with a term expiring on August 31, 2027. With this vacancy, the Council is responsible for electing persons from its own membership to serve on the Commission.\n* CM Parker nominated by CM Toombs\n* CM Hancock nominated by CM Vo\n"
